// Cone-shaped physical burst, same Shockwave shape as spray_of_cards.ron
// (this batch) and axiomancy/pulse_wave.ron. `shockwave_speed *
// shockwave_duration` = 30.0 * 0.6 = 18.0, matching the sheet's "Cone 18"
// reach. The sheet leaves `damage_type` unset ("data.dmg empty in source"),
// noting only "assign weapon-appropriate physical damage" -- ships as
// Piercing, the same damage kind conjuration/ensnaring_strike.ron's `Stab`
// melee already uses for a thrown/bladed effect. The sheet's "half damage on
// a successful Dexterity save" rider has no partial-mitigation primitive on
// `Shockwave` (`damage_effect` only attaches a buff, it can't scale the
// damage roll); `dodgeable: Jump` is kept as the closest already-shipped
// analog (a successful dodge avoids the hit outright, an already-shipped
// simplification, not full/half riders) rather than inventing a new
// mitigation mechanic.
Shockwave(
    energy_cost: 40,
    buildup_duration: 0.5,
    swing_duration: 0.35,
    recover_duration: 0.4,
    damage: 24.0,
    poise_damage: 8,
    knockback: (strength: 4.0, direction: Away),
    shockwave_angle: 60.0,
    shockwave_vertical_angle: 45.0,
    shockwave_speed: 30.0,
    shockwave_duration: 0.6,
    dodgeable: Jump,
    move_efficiency: 0.1,
    damage_kind: Piercing,
    specifier: Ground,
    ori_rate: 1.0,
    timing: PostBuildup,
    emit_outcome: true,
    meta: (school: Some(Conjuration), source: Some(Primordial), cooldown: Some(18.0)),
)
